Modification notice — 2026-09-09
The Glossa contributors modified Readest to create Glossa, including its name,
icons, independent application identity, reading interface, and product scope.
Glossa retains basic reading and cloud synchronization and removes dedicated
AI, translation/dictionary, narration/speed-reading, subscription-feed, public
sharing, and telemetry features. Git history records the individual changes.

Glossa is an independent derivative project. Naming Readest here acknowledges
its origin; it does not claim affiliation, endorsement, or trademark permission.
Readest Cloud remains a separate service subject to its own terms and privacy
policy. Existing service addresses and compatibility identifiers do not identify
a Glossa-operated cloud service.

